Body:
Working config requires two pieces:                                                                                                                     

  1. `opencode.json` in project directory:                                                                                                                 

```
  {                                                                                                                                                           
    "provider": {                                                                                                                                             
      "amazon-bedrock": {                                                                                                                                     
        "models": {
          "kimi-k2.5": {
            "id": "moonshotai.kimi-k2.5",
            "provider": {
              "npm": "@ai-sdk/openai-compatible",
              "api": "https://bedrock-mantle.us-east-1.api.aws/v1"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
```

  2. `~/.local/share/opencode/auth.json` (stores the bearer token):

```
  {
    "amazon-bedrock": {
      "type": "api",
      "key": "<your AWS_BEARER_TOKEN_BEDROCK value>"
    }
  }

```
  Then run with: `opencode run -m "amazon-bedrock/kimi-k2.5"`


The bearer token to be stored in auth.json — `AWS_BEARER_TOKEN_BEDROCK` env var is consumed by the bedrock custom loader but not forwarded as apiKey to `@ai-sdk/openai-compatible`

